        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Hughes, Julia Morris\n- Shows: Australia's Got Talent, another show\n- Roles: host\n\nFacts:\n- Julia Morris did not return as host of Australia's Got Talent season 8 because she was committed to another show.\n- Dave Hughes replaced Julia Morris as host of Australia's Got Talent season 8.\n- Dave Hughes, whose full name is David William \"Hughesy\" Hughes, was born on 26 November 1970 in Warrnambool, Victoria.\n- Dave Hughes is an Australian stand-up comedian and a radio and television presenter.",
